  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Peel and finely chop the garlic. Halve the cherry tomatoes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle the cherry tomatoes with a little oil, sprinkle with salt and air-fry with half of the garlic at 200 °C for 12 minutes.",
      "timerMinutes": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Air-fry the gnocchi at 200 °C for 12 minutes. If your air fryer doesn't have two baskets, you can also fry the gnocchi in a pan with a little oil.",
      "timerMinutes": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "For the dressing, blend half of the grated cheese with the remaining garlic, mayonnaise, yoghurt, red wine vinegar, soy sauce and mustard. Season with pepper and salt."
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the stalk from the romaine, wash the leaves and combine everything in a large bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle the remaining grated cheese and the chives over the portions to garnish."
    }
  ]
